btw NOERR:
tryna {
    yeet "it's so over"
    yap "unreachable"
} caught4k err {
    yap "we're so back: ${err}"       btw OUT: we're so back: it's so over
}

tryna { yeet {"code": 42} } caught4k e { yap e["code"] }     btw OUT: 42
tryna { yeet npc } caught4k e { yap vibeof(e) }              btw OUT: npc

btw built-in errors are catchable and arrive as plain strings
tryna { yap 1 / 0 } caught4k e { yap e }                     btw OUT: can't divide by zero
tryna { yap nobody } caught4k e { yap e }                    btw OUT: `nobody` hasn't been declared with lowkey or highkey
tryna { yap [1][5] } caught4k e { yap e }                    btw OUT: index 5 on a list of length 1
tryna { yap 1 - "a" } caught4k e { yap e }                   btw OUT: can't use '-' on number and string
tryna { clout() } caught4k e { yap e }                       btw OUT: `clout` wants 1 but got 0
tryna { ongod 1 > 2, "lied" } caught4k e { yap e }           btw OUT: lied
tryna { ongod cap } caught4k e { yap e }                     btw OUT: the 'ongod' condition was false

btw unwinding crosses functions and loops, and rethrowing works
cook boom() {
    speedrun i in 1..3 { yeet i }
}
tryna {
    tryna { boom() } caught4k inner { yeet inner + 10 }
} caught4k outer {
    yap outer                                                btw OUT: 11
}

btw errors inside the handler reach the next tryna out
tryna {
    tryna { yeet 1 } caught4k e { yap nope }
} caught4k e { yap "outer got it" }                          btw OUT: outer got it

btw a tryna inside a loop keeps the loop going
speedrun i in 1..2 {
    tryna { yeet i } caught4k e { skibidi }
    yap "never"
}

btw a return from inside tryna leaves the function
cook leave() {
    tryna { itsgiving "left" } caught4k e { }
    itsgiving "stayed"
}
yap leave()                                                  btw OUT: left

btw runaway recursion is an ordinary catchable error, and the stack recovers
cook down(n) { itsgiving down(n + 1) }
tryna { down(0) } caught4k e { yap e }                       btw OUT: function calls went more than 1000 deep
cook depth(n) { vibecheck n == 0 { itsgiving 0 } itsgiving 1 + depth(n - 1) }
yap depth(900)                                               btw OUT: 900

btw touchgrass can't be caught
cook leave_now() { touchgrass 7 }
tryna { leave_now() } caught4k e { yap "caught?!" }
yap "unreachable"
btw EXIT: 7
